To apply the Single Responsibility Principle in this case, you could create separate classes for each responsibility:

```php
class ProductTitle {
  private $title;

  public function __construct($title) {
    $this->title = $title;
  }

  public function setTitle($title) {
    $this->title = $title;
  }

  public function getTitle() {
